    {
      "id": "18085959443176860",
      "text": "if you\u2019re tired of the endless rotation of fast fashion, just head to prettiva.co. \n\nkeep it simple.",
      "posted_at": 1783857965.2491765,
      "views": 29,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784462638.3382347
    },
    {
      "id": "17898668490547271",
      "text": "gold jewelry or silver jewelry.\n\nthere is genuinely no middle ground.",
      "posted_at": 1783868973.4968626,
      "views": 0,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784468886.7405646
    },
    {
      "id": "18110919134058262",
      "text": "why do brands make beautiful things and then put the logo absolutely everywhere?",
      "posted_at": 1783877415.2889316,
      "views": 53,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784475720.7594216
    },
    {
      "id": "17949807405080729",
      "text": "women who match their bags to their shoes to their earrings deserve a documentary.",
      "posted_at": 1783918260.4227705,
      "views": 110,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784520608.3902035
    },
    {
      "id": "17898894054472581",
      "text": "there is a certain kind of woman who always looks good and never talks about it.",
      "posted_at": 1783931142.2528157,
      "views": 60,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784532891.8502579
    },
    {
      "id": "17897406402518143",
      "text": "the \u2018no buy year\u2019 people and the \u2018buy less, buy better\u2019 people are just saying the same thing differently.",
      "posted_at": 1783942862.4999733,
      "views": 69,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784543347.896516
    },
    {
      "id": "17897015307352206",
      "text": "minimal jewelry or stacked.\n\nthere is genuinely no middle ground.",
      "posted_at": 1783960898.4624286,
      "views": 2,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784565658.7843628
    },
    {
      "id": "18126622690732793",
      "text": "why do brands make beautiful things and then plaster a logo all over them?\n\nstop it.",
      "posted_at": 1784000431.6291947,
      "views": 15,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 1,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784596340.4384346
    },
    {
      "id": "18124039240753270",
      "text": "most women who say they 'don't care about clothes' actually think about them the most.",
      "posted_at": 1784017510.3713934,
      "views": 78,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784618657.1082218
    },
    {
      "id": "18084672377243567",
      "text": "women who match their bag to their shoes to their earrings deserve a documentary.",
      "posted_at": 1784030405.8287802,
      "views": 118,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 2,
      "reposts": 1,
      "last_fetched": 1784635115.2009819
    },
    {
      "id": "18170259787427373",
      "text": "if you\u2019re tired of the \u2018buy more, wear once\u2019 cycle, have a look at prettiva.co.",
      "posted_at": 1784044315.5108528,
      "views": 51,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784643339.379817
    },
    {
      "id": "18109556401787640",
      "text": "gold jewelry vs silver jewelry.\nthis is the only personality trait that matters.",
      "posted_at": 1784054673.4093087,
      "views": 26,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 1,
      "last_fetched": 1784655558.9430747
    },
    {
      "id": "18116543858492368",
      "text": "the 7 step morning routine girlies are lying.\nwe all know you're wearing the same hoodie from yesterday.",
      "posted_at": 1784095335.9499624,
      "views": 19,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784670159.8155694
    },
    {
      "id": "18100134986607483",
      "text": "why is the pockets-to-no-pockets ratio in women\u2019s clothing still a hate crime?",
      "posted_at": 1784111173.6418679,
      "views": 142,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 2,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784670159.8155694
    },
    {
      "id": "18185153314397968",
      "text": "people who wear all black to the beach are the only ones getting it right.",
      "posted_at": 1784124382.6415524,
      "views": 19,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784670159.8155694
    },
    {
      "id": "18100179005231075",
      "text": "oversized blazer or cropped jacket. \n\nthere is a right answer and it\u2019s non-negotiable.",
      "posted_at": 1784136852.1485004,
      "views": 2,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784670159.8155694
    },
    {
      "id": "18174843082421695",
      "text": "if your closet is full of clothes with tags still on them, stop lying to yourself. \n\nyou\u2019re not waiting for an occasion.",
      "posted_at": 1784175704.9080744,
      "views": 43,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784670159.8155694
    },
    {
      "id": "18012437105876200",
      "text": "it\u2019s wild how we all buy the same trending pieces but somehow make them look entirely different. \n\nit\u2019s called having a signature.",
      "posted_at": 1784200813.8875315,
      "views": 9,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784670159.8155694
    },
    {
      "id": "18419151577145575",
      "text": "the best outfits happen when you stop trying to 'look like' someone else and just put on what actually feels right.",
      "posted_at": 1784224602.0300827,
      "views": 39,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784670159.8155694
    },
    {
      "id": "17902715352464425",
      "text": "nothing ruins a mood faster than realizing your outfit choice is wildly inappropriate for the specific level of formality of the room.",
      "posted_at": 1784262617.0951917,
      "views": 24,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784670159.8155694
    },
    {
      "id": "18108258260319666",
      "text": "are you a person who keeps the tags on until the very last second, or do you rip them off the moment you get home?",
      "posted_at": 1784290725.18081,
      "views": 79,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784670159.8155694
    },
    {
      "id": "18006570905955184",
      "text": "the most judgmental look you get isn't from your enemies. it's from women who know exactly how long it took you to style that outfit.",
      "posted_at": 1784312068.456994,
      "views": 6,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784670159.8155694
    },
    {
      "id": "17899674933535682",
      "text": "everyone claims they dress for comfort until they find a piece that makes them feel powerful.\n\nthen comfort suddenly doesn't matter.",
      "posted_at": 1784347872.787384,
      "views": 132,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784670159.8155694
    },
    {
      "id": "17900448291499297",
      "text": "the \u2018closet audit\u2019 trend is just a fancy way of admitting we have no idea how to style the things we already own.",
      "posted_at": 1784368970.8301191,
      "views": 162,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784670159.8155694
    },
    {
      "id": "17936799423292949",
      "text": "owning exactly five perfect shirts is better than owning thirty mediocre ones. \n\nstop cluttering your own life.",
      "posted_at": 1784391282.14902,
      "views": 54,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 2,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784670159.8155694
    },
    {
      "id": "18070182353414897",
      "text": "wearing socks with sandals: a bold fashion statement or a cry for help? pick one.",
      "posted_at": 1784436010.5786238,
      "views": 8,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784670159.8155694
    },
    {
      "id": "18169619077451253",
      "text": "everyone has that one piece of clothing they\u2019d wear to their own funeral if they could.",
      "posted_at": 1784452965.4106472,
      "views": 69,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 3,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784670159.8155694
    },
    {
      "id": "18148546501508455",
      "text": "if you never repeat an outfit in public, you aren't stylish. you're just stressed.",
      "posted_at": 1784468923.9435527,
      "views": 46,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784670159.8155694
    },
    {
      "id": "17875826592523251",
      "text": "the \u2018i\u2019m just running errands\u2019 outfit that actually took forty minutes to assemble.",
      "posted_at": 1784520640.309139,
      "views": 46,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784670159.8155694
    },
    {
      "id": "18063396089727435",
      "text": "ironing clothes is a personality type.\n\ni refuse to acknowledge the wrinkled aesthetic.",
      "posted_at": 1784543379.26926,
      "views": 59,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784670159.8155694
    },
    {
      "id": "18085904600181393",
      "text": "laundry day. \n\ndo you re-wear your jeans until they can stand on their own or do you wash them after one use? \n\nlet\u2019s be honest.",
      "posted_at": 1784565694.014052,
      "views": 2,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784670159.8155694
    },
    {
      "id": "17856080592696296",
      "text": "the \u2018capsule wardrobe\u2019 is just a fancy term for people who are scared of bold choices.",
      "posted_at": 1784608614.705387,
      "views": 27,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784670159.8155694
    },
    {
      "id": "18336608620268564",
      "text": "if you can\u2019t sit down comfortably in your outfit, you didn\u2019t actually get dressed, you just put on a costume.",
      "posted_at": 1784628336.8074422,
      "views": 162,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784670159.8155694
    },
    {
      "id": "17925771453367695",
      "text": "everyone claims they hate trends, yet the whole city is wearing the same shade of butter yellow.",
      "posted_at": 1784649409.6943762,
      "views": 14,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1784670159.8155694
    }
  ]
}